references:
  - type: report
    title: "The Language-Resonant Oscillator — technical disclosure"
    abstract: >-
      Standalone technical description of the oscillator implemented in akróasys,
      written for a reader outside the project: system architecture, the format
      of the curated parametrised code library, the two-turn consultation in
      which the language model names which library entries it wants opened, the
      fixed host scaffold, the compile-verify-repair loop, derivation of the
      player's control surface from the generated program, and what is
      deliberately absent. Published as a defensive publication.
    authors:
      - family-names: "Jörissen"
        given-names: "Benjamin"
        name-prefix: "Prof. Dr."
    year: 2026
    url: "https://github.com/joeriben/akroasys/blob/main/docs/LRO_TECHNICAL_DISCLOSURE.md"
